# Local additions to the IPBES thesaurus (data/helpers/ipbes-thesaurus.rdf).
#
# thesaurus_helper.py loads this file on top of the official RDF, so every
# triple here behaves as if it were in the thesaurus itself. Use standard
# SKOS so the additions can be proposed upstream or shared as linked data:
#
#   skos:altLabel  another name that should find a concept
#   skos:related   a curated link between two concepts
#
# Labels shorter than 5 characters are ignored when matching text (unless
# they are acronyms), so "city" and "town" are not listed.

@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix th:   <https://ibok.ipbes.net/thesaurus/> .

# Urban. The thesaurus has no "City" concept; its definition already
# reads "the built-up, human-inhabited environment (cities, towns, villages)".
th:9431 skos:altLabel "cities"@en, "towns"@en, "urban area"@en, "urban areas"@en .
